  "id": "linear-regression",
  "term": "linear regression",
  "definition": "Linear regression is a research method used to predict an outcome variable from one or more predictor variables. In the simple form it fits a straight line to estimate the outcome from one predictor, typically choosing the line that minimizes squared prediction errors; multiple regression uses two or more predictors.",
